# generated + local artefacts — the station never commits its live store (OPS.md owns backups)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
symbiont/store/
symbiont/literature/mcp-server/node_modules/
/tmp/
# editor + rollback leftovers — untrackable, so a committed backup cannot return
# (req-P1-THE-PUBLIC-TREE-HAS-NO-DEBRIS-AND-NAM: the same names guix.scm's packaging filter
#  and `make check`'s hygiene step refuse)
*.bak-*
*~
*.orig
*.rej
